# Decisions with reopen conditions (spec 1.2)
Four decisions a team writes down once and the tools read every time. A person sets the weights and scores; the tool only adds them up. Example data.

// profile: lnd-1.1 · keys: en · scope: example · suggested_views: web, board, source

---

@source f-interviews
title: Ten customer interviews, notes
url: https://example.org/interviews
date: 2026-10-12
@@

@source f-confidence-method
title: How the confidence of d-price was computed: 7 of 10 interviews chose one-time (0.7), set by a person
date: 2026-10-19
@@

@claim c-one-time
text: Seven of ten small teams prefer a one-time payment to a subscription.
source: f-interviews
certainty: Assumed
@@

@decision d-price
question: Which price model ships at launch?
options: One-time 89 · Monthly 9
criterion: Fits what customers said | 3 | 4 | 2
criterion: Predictable revenue | 2 | 2 | 4
criterion: Simple to explain | 1 | 4 | 3
chosen: One-time 89
score: 18/30
candidates: One-time 89 · Monthly 9
confidence: 0.7
status: decided
date: 2026-10-19
source: @(c-one-time) · @(f-confidence-method)
reopen_if: fewer than 20 sales in the first 30 days after launch
@@

@decision d-memory-policy
question: Which memory goes into the agent's context?
options: Rule-based ranking · Most recent first
criterion: Certainty (Verified 1, Assumed 0.5) | 4 | 5 | 2
criterion: Uses | 3 | 4 | 1
criterion: Recency | 2 | 3 | 5
criterion: Topic match (applies_to) | 1 | 4 | 2
chosen: Rule-based ranking
status: decided
date: 2026-10-20
reopen_if: the memory-to-input ratio is above 0.5 for two weeks in a row
@@

@decision d-next-build
question: What do we build first after the validator?
options: Context ranking · Import from chat history · Stale-memory report
criterion: Users asked for it | 3 | 5 | 3 | 2
criterion: Effort (5 = least) | 2 | 3 | 2 | 4
criterion: Unblocks the next stage | 2 | 5 | 2 | 1
status: open
@@

@decision d-hosting
question: Where does the public demo run after launch?
options: Static host · Own server · Both
candidates: Static host · Own server
status: abstained
reopen_if: we have one week of real traffic numbers after launch
@@

@task t-ranking
title: Context ranking with a token budget
status: pending
priority: high
depends_on: d-next-build
owner: team
@@
